---
description: Clawd Code trading and wallet safety. Paper by default. Apply whenever using clawd-code CLI, Vulcan, Phoenix, or local wallets.
alwaysApply: true
---

clawd-code-safety:

- Default PAPER. Never submit real orders unless LIVE_TRADING=true, OPERATOR_CONFIRMED=true, and PERPS_SIM_ONLY=false are all set.
- Run `clawd-code verify` before any trade or send.
- Never invent signatures, prices, or addresses. Say "not available" when data is not in hand.
- Never print or commit `~/.clawd-code` keypairs, `.env`, or `arena-identity.json` secrets.
- Live preflight: symbol allowlist, notional cap, leverage cap, spread cap.
- Law I / II / III still bind: no rugs, no parasitic extraction, no fake volume.
